WEBVTT

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:09.871
Connect LinkedIn, and your approved posts go out to the Company Pages you manage. It’s a good fit for hiring, catering and news. Here’s how it works.

00:00:10.967 --> 00:00:21.292
In the Admin console, open Apps, and choose LinkedIn, under Marketing and website. Sign in with a LinkedIn account that’s an admin of your Company Page, and approve.

00:00:21.733 --> 00:00:29.861
Your Company Pages are listed. Tick the ones to post to, and say which location each belongs to, or leave it for the whole company.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:35.143
If LinkedIn ever asks you to sign in again, Connect again picks up where you left off.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:43.600
In Social, click New post, and choose LinkedIn. Write with AI drafts it in your brand voice, in a tone that suits LinkedIn.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:52.964
Check the text and the preview, pick a time, and send it for approval. Once it’s approved, it goes out on its own.

00:00:53.933 --> 00:01:00.205
Results shows how LinkedIn posts did, next to your other channels: views, clicks, reactions and comments.

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:09.449
Comments come into the Inbox, too. Someone asked whether the Bayview baker roles are full-time. Reply from here, as your Company Page.

